                {
                  "id": "about-t1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien Truck Group is the largest commercial truck dealer in South\nCarolina and a leading truck dealer group in South Florida, providing\npresence of sales, service and support for medium, heavy and severe-\nservice International trucks. We also sell and service IC Bus, Hino Trucks\nand other commercial work trucks. To support customer uptime, Rechtien\nTruck Group has over $8 million in stocked parts and a state-of-the-art\npaint booth & body shop in both states (Columbia & Riviera Beach). Our\nLeasing & Rental division, Idealease, provides short-term and long-term\nsolutions through truck leasing, rental and mobile maintenance support.\nays.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "about-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "\nJoin a company of over 360 employees who enjoy multiple incentive plans, tool\ncertification programs and more. Our comprehensive benefits plan includes\nhealth, dental and vision insurance, 401(k) with company match, paid holidays,\nvacation days & personal d",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
